{"about":["Upin & Ipin Universe is a vibrant open-world adventure that brings the charm of tropical Southeast Asian village life to players worldwide.","Inspired by the beloved Upin & Ipin animated series, it invites players to explore the lively Kampung Durian Runtuh — a living, breathing world filled with authentic sights, sounds, and traditions, crafted by Malaysians for the world.","From bustling markets to quiet rice fields, it captures the essence of kampung (village) life—fireflies at dusk, swaying coconut palms, and the aroma of home-cooked meals. Play as Upin and Ipin on a heartfelt journey, uncovering local legends, helping their community, and immersing themselves in Malaysia’s rich culture, rooted in the heart of Southeast Asia.","Offline multiplayer (2 players)","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Software subject to license (us.playstation.com/softwarelicense)."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/543cb19084168982ab241259f663ac2222c7eccf9c7906a4.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/543cb19084168982ab241259f663ac2222c7eccf9c7906a4.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/ff37497387788a04ffb649674046f77500e8a5b54fdd4a5a.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/ff37497387788a04ffb649674046f77500e8a5b54fdd4a5a.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/62ff878f50b90dda4de275837d0af25d882ba99a3ed92d10.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/62ff878f50b90dda4de275837d0af25d882ba99a3ed92d10.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/60309ca9c1cbb71ae70fb069da218007a4e182225f22f8db.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202512/1505/60309ca9c1cbb7